   plot="Agnes Grey, the daughter of a poor clergyman, takes a post with the Bloomfield family and then with the Murrays, and the novel records in close detail the humiliations of her position, the indiscipline of her charges and the indifference of their parents. She falls in love with the curate Edward Weston, is separated from him, and is reunited when her family's circumstances change and he seeks her out.",
